BT 1 0 0 1 0 120 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 14.4 TL (Daron Acemoglu points out that while AI can handle) Tj T* (massive data parsing, human researchers excel in) Tj T* (contextual reasoning, ethical considerations and) Tj T* (creativity. By uniting these strengths, we can move) Tj T* (beyond mere efficiency gains toward entirely new) Tj T* (forms of inquiry. Acemoglu has said that \223we currently) Tj T* -0.055801 Tw (have the wrong direction for AI. We\222re using it too much) Tj T* 0 Tw (for automation and not enough for providing expertise) Tj T* (and information to workers.\224) Tj T* ET
