.043137 .062745 .05098 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 48 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 14.4 TL (Still, the risk of automation overshadowing human skill) Tj T* (development looms. The challenge is to harness the) Tj T* -0.004401 Tw (benefits of AI while ensuring that new tasks are created) Tj T* 0 Tw (that humans are needed for.) Tj T* ET
