.043137 .062745 .05098 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 206.4 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 14.4 TL (The promise of AI-driven research hinges on how) Tj T* (responsibly we create, use, and consume new) Tj T* (knowledge. As a recent article in the Harvard Business) Tj T* (Review has observed, \223While many organizations have) Tj T* (made strides in developing AI principles, the real) Tj T* (challenge lies in embedding these principles into the) Tj T* (fabric of daily operations. Leaders, particularly those in) Tj T* (nontechnical roles, are instrumental in this process,) Tj T* (advocating for practical resources, fostering a culture) Tj T* (that values ethical AI, and ensuring that responsible AI) Tj T* (practices are a fundamental aspect of) Tj T* (decision-making.\224 While self-regulation is a start, many) Tj T* (experts argue that formal oversight mechanisms are) Tj T* (necessary, given how quickly AI is evolving and how) Tj T* (high the stakes are.) Tj T* ET
Q
