q
.043137 .062745 .05098 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 33.6 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 14.4 TL (Ethical, rigorous, scientific work will not vanish, instead) Tj T* (it will evolve, with leaders integrating AI within the) Tj T* (research and discovery pipeline.) Tj T* ET
