.043137 .062745 .05098 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 120 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 14.4 TL (As AI advances, concerns about workforce) Tj T* (displacement surface. Historically, though, new) Tj T* (technologies have tended to reshape labour markets) Tj T* (rather than simply eliminating jobs. AI may reduce the) Tj T* (need for routine tasks like data entry and literature) Tj T* (reviews, but in doing so it could create new roles: AI) Tj T* (ethicists, data curators, model auditors, and) Tj T* (\223human-in-the-loop\224 specialists ensuring quality and) Tj T* (ethical standards.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 314.6457 408.7071 cm
q
.043137 .062745 .05098 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 134.4 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 14.4 TL (Still, the transition won\222t be frictionless. Without) Tj T* (deliberate efforts to broaden access, smaller) Tj T* (institutions and individuals who are not capable of) Tj T* (using AI could be left behind. Just as open-source) Tj T* (software revolutionized coding, open-access AI) Tj T* (platforms can democratise research. But that requires) Tj T* (investments in infrastructure and education, as well as) Tj T* (institutional willingness to share data and model) Tj T* (architectures rather than guarding them as proprietary) Tj T* (secrets.) Tj T* ET
